SUMMARY:A Woman Called Sada Abe
LOCATION:Japan Society\, 333 East 47th Street\, Manhattan
DESCRIPTION:35mm Import. Made the year before Oshima’s In Realm of the 
 Senses\, Noboru Tanaka’s rendition of the Sada Abe incident rests with 
 Junko Miyashita’s fierce portrayal of the infamous figure\, whose all-c
 onsuming affair culminates in a notorious act that would grip a nation al
 ready in the throes of rising militarism. https://japansociety.org/events
 /a-woman-called-sada-abe/
URL:https://japansociety.org/events/a-woman-called-sada-abe/
END:VEVENT
