SUMMARY:Galaxie
LOCATION:Anthology Film Archives\, 32 Second Avenue\, Manhattan
DESCRIPTION:A pinnacle of the art of filmic portraiture\, Gregory Markopo
 ulos’s GALAXIE comprises thirty short portraits of men and women from a
 cross the spectrum of the mid-1960s cultural scene in New York City. Its 
 subjects include many of Markopoulos’s fellow experimental filmmakers 
 – Storm De Hirsch\, George & Mike Kuchar\, Jonas Mekas\, Shirley Clarke
 \, Amy Taubin\, and Ed Emshwiller – as well as figures from… https://
 www.anthologyfilmarchives.org/film_screenings/calendar?view=list&month=11
 &year=2026#showing-62284
