DTSTAMP:20261120T105341Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261122
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261123
SUMMARY:Essential Cinema: Lawrence Jordan
LOCATION:Anthology Film Archives\, 32 Second Avenue\, Manhattan
DESCRIPTION:DUO CONCERTANTES (1962-64\, 6 min\, 16mm\, b&w) HAMFAT ASAR (
 1965\, 13 min\, 16mm\, b&w) GYMNOPEDIES (1968\, 6 min\, 16mm) THE OLD HOU
